WEBVTT

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.460
Futakoi Alternative

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.460
Translation by AnimeYuki

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.780
Run at once towards a dream

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.780
yume no mukou e ikkini hashitte yo

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.750
Let’s meet and laugh away yesterday’s troubles

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.750
nayameru kinou wo fungiri warai aou

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:44.830
When our memories were here,

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:44.830
omoide ga itta no toki mo

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.020
even though we are deeply hurt, go straight on

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.020
kizu wo fukai no ni massugu mae ni

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.320
GO TO NEW WORLD

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:54.440
I can feel it in the wind

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:54.440
kaze no naka kanjiteru yo

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.950
The hot beat is shining

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.950
atsui kodou kagayaku yo

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.580
especially now…

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.580
ima koso

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:07.630
surely, always, you’ll be by my side

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:07.630
kitto zutto soba ni iru yo ne

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:12.630
Keep on running the way to the future.

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:12.630
mirai no michi wo hashiri tsuzukeyou

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:17.270
more and more, no matter what happens

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:17.270
motto motto nani ga okitemo

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:21.480
half our tears become double smiles

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:21.480
namida wa hanbun nibai no egao ni naru

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.030
forever

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.030
itsudemo

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.530
Headquarters! This is an emergency!

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:39.730
Requesting reinforcements!

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:40.830
We’re being attacked by a monster!

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:50.720
Rara-chan!

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.060
Rara-chan!

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:59.630
Scary! Stay away! NO!

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:03.180
Ruru-chan!

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.280
Leave this to me!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.730
Take this!

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:12.530
No way!

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.570
What is this monster?!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.620
Emergency… Emergency…

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:23.790
The shutters are closing!

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:25.530
Let’s go Ruru-chan!

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:26.030
Yeah!

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:28.710
Wait!

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.360
Out of the way, Rara-chan!

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:37.280
Rara-chan, hurry up!

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.000
Yeah!

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.350
It’s coming!

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:47.810
Rara-chan!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:49.330
There!

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:09.160
You’re all slimy, Rara-chan!

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.040
You too, Ruru-chan.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.850
What the heck is up with this thing?!

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:01.090
So so, where in the world are we now, Rara-chan?

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.890
Well well, this must be somewhere in Japan. There’s no mistake about it.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:09.580
What what?

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:10.930
Futagotamagawa?

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.930
Which came first? The chicken or the egg?

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.890
This is the river that someone gave the name Futagotamagawa.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:20.900
It might have been named that because a lot of the residents around here twins.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.680
Or, because it has the name “Futagotamagawa,” it could also be that…

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:27.930
being around it has some miraculous effect on conception that causes more twins.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.790
That’s something I am not really clear on.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.880
The only thing I am clear on is the name “Nikoniko Financers”.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:38.130
It’s not called that because the employees are always smiling…

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.380
It’s Nikotama’s moneylender. That’s why it’s Nikoniko.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.280
There’s probably no mistake about it.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.850
It’s definitely anything but honest.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.530
This is the present me:
Futaba Rentarou, 21 years old.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:58.940
Occupation: Private detective.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.830
And this is the situation right now.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.730
Introducing Sakurazuki Zenji, 72 years old.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.730
Occupation: Boss of the Sakurazuki yakuza group.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.830
This story happened thirty years ago.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.880
I was unskilled back then, too.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.980
Even if I pretended otherwise,
I wasn’t able to give up on my woman.

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.890
It was a tragic story.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.380
I-I’m gonna kill you!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:37.430
Your father and I had a considerably painful past, and should have ended it there.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:44.600
He took one of my hands, stepped on the honor of the yakuza,

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:47.480
and even raised such a handsome son.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.990
Right now, I am pleased and thankful for that.

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:52.160
S-Sorry to trouble you…

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.960
All of us are gonna kill you!

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.080
M-My apologies…

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.330
Hey hey, stop.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.620
This is actually quite convenient.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:17.380
Futaba Rentarou, 21 years old.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:19.180
Occupation: Private detective.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.230
Situation: Violent crisis.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.400
Now, how did all this begin?

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.910
Is it already the second anniversary of his death? Time flies…

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.480
Yamada Kankurou, 23 years old.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:39.960
Occupation: Head of Nikoniko Kinyuu sales, or second-in-command of the Sakurazuki  group.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.720
It was a regrettable loss, indeed.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.550
Thank you for your sentiments.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:48.550
And this is me, 2 hours earlier.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:54.600
I made the director a bit angry.
I’m sorry for that.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:58.230
If you want another cup of coffee, please drink it quickly.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:58.780
Right.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:04.180
It’s rare nowadays to find men like your dad.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:06.430
That’s the opinion of my company’s president.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:09.980
You too… If you’re to follow in your father’s footsteps, clean up your act a bit.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:12.870
Nidaime = Second Generation.
It’s a sort of nickname for Rentarou.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:10.980
Right, Nidaime?

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.870
Yeah. Sorry…

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:16.550
Oh well.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.830
By the way, it must have been hard keeping Piiko-chan.

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:24.580
I hope you won’t tell the director that I entrusted it to you.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:29.080
I have responsibilities. While they’re on
vacation, I’m supposed to look after the house.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.830
But that damned bird kept going “pii pii,”

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:33.630
I couldn’t sleep, dammit.

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:35.880
Still, the director seems to adore it.

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:36.830
Right?

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.480
Well… Umm… You want to eat some crackers?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.280
I don’t need them.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:41.430
Anyways, where is Piiko-chan?

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.030
Inside…

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:44.940
Where?

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:51.950
Don’t mess with me!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.030
Don’t mess with me!!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.320
You’ve gotta be kidding me!

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.880
Geez, that’s not funny!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.880
That Nidaime is useless.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:06.390
Making you go all this way to buy food for a three person dinner with 300 yen!

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.830
What’s the meaning of this?

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.630
Even though he’s lucky enough to have such a cute girl.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:13.730
Not at all. I like to help out, so I don’t mind.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:16.130
Oh, so cute!

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.730
I’ll give you 3 croquettes as a present, okay?

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.660
Ah, thank you very much!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.180
Oh, that voice… could it be…

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.480
Hello, this is Nikotama Television!

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:29.230
Oh, is the interview today?

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.530
Didn’t we phone you this morning?

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.030
Oh yeah, that’s right.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.880
Hold on a bit, I’ll come right out.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:36.290
HOT!!!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:41.950
Umm… hello?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.250
It’s hopeless!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.680
I’ll be killed! I’ll be killed!

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:48.880
It’s hopeless! Utterly hopeless!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.430
Stop babbling with that pathetic voice.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.830
The police wouldn’t help much either?

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:54.680
No, no!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.370
I would end up being arrested as well!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:58.260
All right!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.180
I accept.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.080
Really?

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.130
With honor, kindness, patience, and with absolute confidentiality,

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.830
we will help you to sort through your disputes and betrayals.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:05.520
Young lady!

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:09.980
Leave it up to the Futaba Detective Office!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.330
Shirogane Sara, 15 years old.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.880
Occupation: Female high school student.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.160
Self-styled first assistant of the Futaba Detective Agency.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:17.430
U-Ummm…

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:18.760
Speaking of which, since I’m only an assistant,

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:21.780
you’ll have to go through the details with the boss and other assistant as well.

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:22.530
It’s good, but…

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:23.380
Ah, sorry, sorry!

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:24.780
Sara, Shirogane Sara!

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:28.230
A proud and beautiful girl from the Futaba Detective Office. Okay?

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:28.980
Yeah…

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.330
Okay, let’s put it here.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:31.010
Ah, found it!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.830
What are you doing?

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:38.330
Hmm, the timer… is set.

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:38.880
All right!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:44.930
Come on, you’re now just gonna jump out of the second story window with me!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.930
Ah, I’m so happy!

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:47.730
“JUST?!”

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.180
It’s just jumping isn’t it?

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:50.830
“Just?!”

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:52.480
Do you wanna get caught?

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:52.820
Huh?

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.380
Do you wanna be executed?

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:54.940
Wha?!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.210
Okay! It’s decided!

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:01.580
Hey, just when did you put this rope around me?

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:07.080
You first!

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:10.230
I’m gonna die!

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:14.780
She’s very persistent, but she’s my number one assistant.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.090
By the way, she’s well known.

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:20.300
Gen-san! We’re taking your bike!

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:26.520
By the way, that person is Gen-san.
He’s like a big brother to me.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:40.230
To satisfy my pride,
I’m definitely gonna kill him.

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:43.530
Boss. There’s a weird noise, but…

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:44.330
Huh?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.990
It seems to be in Japanese.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:57.380
Somehow, there was an incredible explosion.

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:00.140
Somehow, a lot of smoke is coming out.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.830
Kinoshita Hinokichi, 26 years old.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.600
Occupation: Policeman at the
Futagotamagawa local police station.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:12.810
Well… That’s okay, I think.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:17.130
Pick up! Pick up! Pick up! Geez! Calm down!

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.490
How can I?!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:22.490
Hello? Sorry, but this is TV’s cute girl…

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.980
Somehow something like that is…

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.380
What, fired?

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:27.980
And you’re flying to Macau?!

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:28.500
THE HECK?!

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:32.000
Sorry about that, if only I had been more careful not to burn myself…

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.830
Sugisaku’s female owner,
Koto Michiru-san, 36 years old.

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:38.030
Occupation: Manager of the Sugisaku meat store,

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.510
president of the Futagotamagawa business association.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.220
I will try to do my best.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:45.230
Does that mean…
He really has gone to Macau?

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.930
I will go and play.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.630
Thanks for the incredible service- THE HECK?

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:50.860
Well then…

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.480
Wah! This delicious treat!

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:03.880
When you eat it, it’s like
everything’s  perfect.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:08.080
Surely, this is the best
croquette in the world!

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:09.620
How is it?

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.780
Shirogane Soujyu, 15 years old.

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:13.580
Occupation: Female high school student.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.650
Self-styled Futaba Detective Agency’s second assistant.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:16.970
Is it?

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:19.430
Argh, geez!

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:20.680
Answer, answer, answer, answer!!

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:22.000
I can’t answer.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:23.890
What?

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.680
Our pursuers are right behind us!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.640
I know that! Just hold on a bit longer will ya?!

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.620
What will you do if they catch us?

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:37.060
Umm…

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:42.990
Senpai?

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:50.880
Kinoshita.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.880
Hariyama Nishimori, 29 years old.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:55.430
Occupation: Policeman at the
Futagotamagawa local police station.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:56.780
Alias “Dirty Harry.”

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.000
Y-Yes!

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:01.500
Smash them! Smash them!

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:04.470
T-That…!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.830
And I said I can’t answer…

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.230
The bike of the tofu shop’s Gen-san…

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.030
Damn that cursed thing!

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.480
…don’t underestimate it!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:21.700
SORRY!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:22.610
Fire!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:23.950
Let’s cut them off!

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.950
Delicious!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.450
White…

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:39.630
Second in command?

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.330
Yeah.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.630
Is that a joke?

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:42.460
Bloody serious.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:43.780
Bet on Rentarou!

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:45.610
Whether it’s because of K-1 fighting or the influence of our pride,

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.140
we’ve considerably raised the stakes here.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:51.310
Compared to be moneylending gig, this may be more profitable.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:52.940
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:05.530
Although this does seem ike a gamble, it’s also a show.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.240
Show?

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.330
The victory is mine!

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:10.330
Come at me with all your might!
I’ll rip ya apart!

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.230
A cruel show.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:15.580
I see.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.030
It’s a miracle.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:19.090
Everyone in the studio!

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:20.680
Please look!

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:22.730
Soon this will be a great picture!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.480
Croquette Experience!

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:25.880
Everyone also wants to hurry and have one!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.640
Starting today, everyone please try out this miracle!

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:29.730
Sorry for making you wait!

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:31.930
You wanted eight with vegetables and ten with cream?

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.130
Yes, this is the Sugisaki meat store!

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:36.330
I’m sorry, we’re fresh out.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.330
Sorry for making you wait!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.520
Here’s your order.

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:41.180
I’m not needed here.

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.030
Hey! That’s incredible service, isn’t it?

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.280
Well, just have a look.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.360
It’s flourishing!

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:50.330
Senpai…?

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:51.680
Isn’t this a bad idea?

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:52.630
What?

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:53.730
The patrol car.

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.030
It’s a speeder!

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:58.880
They’re sure gonna get mad at us for you making unauthorized modifications.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.430
Here they come!

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:02.180
All right…

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.080
Stop right there!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.730
Can’t you hear me?
I TOLD YOU TO STOP, DAMMIT!!!

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.020
You better stop, Sara-chan!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.480
Somehow, they are telling us to stop.

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:14.780
I KNOW!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:15.880
How annoying!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:16.780
I’m sorry.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.900
I can’t do that!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.630
Hey, hey, hey, HEY!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:23.900
Don’t do reckless things!

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.440
COME ON!!

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.010
Sara-san!

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:50.680
Darn, can’t reach Soujyu either!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:52.880
Even though I am working <i>this</i> hard…

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:55.060
Just what the heck are you doing and where?!

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.930
Yes, four curry croquettes and eight cream croquettes, right?

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.780
Thank you very much!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:02.380
Umm… Is there really no way I can be let off?

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:03.430
Let you off?

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:04.130
Yo!

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:04.810
Nidaime.

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:10.830
I spent so much money to catch Piiko-chan. Isn’t that so pitiful?

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.080
T-That’s right!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.180
Here’s advice.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:13.490
What?

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.830
That guy is strong. I mean, really strong.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.530
Yup.

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:23.030
In his whole career, he has never been defeated in three rounds.

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:24.780
Like, he’s never been unexpectedly punched down?

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.500
It’s to please the public.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.520
Over, there, go face him and show him your middle finger.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:31.130
What?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.930
That way it’ll be over in the first round.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:33.980
I’m gonna be killed!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:37.800
You can choose between being killed in one strike or dying very, very slowly.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.360
Huh?

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:40.310
Let’s begin!

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.850
W-Wa-Wait! Wa-Wait!! Hey!!!

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.520
ARE YOU SERIOUS???

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.530
H-How persistent!

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.230
Can you use a mobile phone?

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:54.290
P-Probably…

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:57.700
Search with the GPS to locate Rentarou’s whereabouts!

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:03.130
I graduated from fist fights when I was eighteen, but…

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.130
Nidaime!!

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.960
The middle finger, middle finger, middle finger!!!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.630
Middle finger!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:12.080
Uhm… I can’t show him my middle finger though! Middle finger…

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.510
Wait… wait, wait, wait!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.220
What… What is up with this crowd of people??

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.930
Oh, wasn’t that Sara-chan?

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.130
Isn’t that Gen-san’s bike?

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.680
Right right, it’s loaded with a super-boost…

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:27.480
HOW NOISY!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.380
Darn, they are overdoing it!

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:31.660
Move it, move it, move it!!!

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:36.950
You’re kidding me!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.930
Welcome!

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:39.500
Oh?

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.670
Sara-chan!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.380
Follow that helicopter!

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:50.210
Wait! Please let me come with!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:52.930
Don’t come! Don’t come!

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:53.920
It’s no good!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.510
Oh yeah! Turbo booster ON!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:06.600
Buster 3 has successfully hit the target. Returning now.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.730
I-It’s a miracle!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.530
It’s not a miracle!

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:14.530
It happened by itself.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.130
But what are we going to do now?

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.280
Rentarou!!!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:22.130
Would he really be of any help in a situation like this?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.540
Isn’t that obvious?

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.500
It’s me and Soujyu’s Rentarou, after all!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.430
It’s okay if we’re following the helicopter?

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.960
Sorry about asking for the impossible.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:32.880
Don’t worry about it.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.580
It’s a scoop, a scoop!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:37.430
By the way, what is that Rentarou like?

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:39.720
He’s a soft-hearted person.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.430
Has a strong personality.

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:43.830
A heavy smoker.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.100
A university dropout.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.980
And he has a weird name.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.650
He is… deceiving you, no?

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.680
He’s poor… and quite staggering…

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:53.380
But!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.070
When it’s time to do it…

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.080
… he’ll do it!

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:58.370
Cut it out already!

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:18.010
Sakurazuki.

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:22.180
And what about our bets?
Twenty million, twenty million!

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.020
I’m gonna have him take responsibility and make him commit suicide!

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:25.330
I did it!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.280
I’m gonna kill him.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:30.730
What is that?

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.430
Let’s do it.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.030
Yeah.

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:40.620
Hariyama and Kinoshita!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.450
Stop that!!!

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:43.450
Ready?

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:45.280
FIRE!

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:50.730
NOOO!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:54.630
Reporter-san! Hurry!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:55.670
Leave it to me!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.380
Umm…

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.380
This is where I break my bonds with my father, right?

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:04.020
SHUT UP!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:07.480
Do you think that it’s the fault of this “bond” that it has come to this?!

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:08.600
B-boss!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.560
Excuse me, Nidaime.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.150
Just die.

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:18.280
What?

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.160
She’s done it! Sara-chan!

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:31.830
What on earth…

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.030
What the fuck?

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.280
Don’t make fun of me!

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.170
What’s with you bastards?!

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.830
What’s with you bastards?!

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.930
You’ve gotten in my way!

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:43.780
HUH?!

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:46.070
I don’t know what the hell you’re going on about!

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:49.680
Did you think you could continue on
after crashing us like that?

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.230
Shut up, you punks!

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:53.330
I’m gonna arrest all of you and throw you in jail!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.330
So shut the hell up!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.270
What is going on with them?

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:03.490
Rentarou.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.980
S-Sara!

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:06.030
What are you doing here?

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:07.430
That’s my line!

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:09.230
What have you been doing here?

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:10.010
What, you ask?

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.580
Boxing?

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:12.280
WHAT?

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:16.180
I always tell you to answer my calls right away, RIGHT?

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:18.230
Thanks to that, I had to search the whole town-

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:20.780
Sara-chan! Rentarou! Hey!

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:20.480
This is a scoop, a scoop!

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:21.680
I’ll become famous!

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:22.180
Huh?

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:22.840
Soujyu?

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.260
Heeeeey!

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.580
It’s Soujyu-chan indeed!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:28.670
What are you doing here?

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:34.280
Somehow something bad happened, right?

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:36.080
H-Hold on a sec!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.080
What on earth happened here?

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.380
Let’s analyze the circumstances.

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:43.780
Wanna eat some croquettes?

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:44.280
Yeah.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:50.160
W-Where is this? Where am I?

00:21:50.980 --> 00:21:51.630
Shall we go home?

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:52.580
Yes!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.780
The glaring match continued for three hours.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:06.430
Cleaning the various things here seems hopeless, Sara-chan.

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:09.930
I-Isn’t that okay? There’ll be a redecoration renewal…

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:11.780
This isn’t Pachinko.

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:14.180
Next time, don’t use any
self-destructing devices.

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:17.380
But, I didn’t have any other
choice back then…

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:18.020
That’s not an excuse.

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:21.230
But… The situation suddenly became odd…

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:22.430
That’s why you shouldn’t do it.

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:24.910
I’m sorry.

00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:29.780
Rentarou, Sara-chan also tried her very best to do her work…

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:47.330
My name is Futaba Rentarou.

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:48.980
Age: 21 years old.

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:50.430
Occupation: Private detective.

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:53.080
And these are my two assistants.

00:22:54.530 --> 00:22:56.760
Today’s result is the collapse of the office.

00:22:57.530 --> 00:22:59.500
What? It’s not like we’re gonna abandon it.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:14.530
Say…

00:23:15.730 --> 00:23:16.380
Huh?

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:20.170
We are two people, but…

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:25.260
if we become three,
it feels much better, right?

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:28.980
Yes.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:35.800
We are here.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:35.630
bokura wa koko ni iru

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:43.200
We will be here.

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:43.200
bokura ga koko ni aru

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:48.520
The slow time is

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:48.520
yuruyaka na jikan ga

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:55.450
flowing in this room.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:55.450
nagareteru kono heya de

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:59.050
Even if the summer days vanish,

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:59.050
natsu no hi ga kiete mo

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:03.110
the smiles that remain

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:03.110
nokoru egao tachi

00:24:03.230 --> 00:24:09.990
are a chain of happiness up to this point.

00:24:03.230 --> 00:24:09.990
kocchi made shiawase no rensa

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:15.830
Ah, the meaning of honesty,

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:15.830
aa sunaosa no imi

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:24.170
is within the innermost depths of your heart.

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:24.170
KOKORO no zutto zutto oku no hou e

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:29.550
Hey, the days are wonderful

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:29.550
nee subarashii hibi

00:24:29.850 --> 00:24:37.310
in the midst of weakness and anxiety.

00:24:29.850 --> 00:24:37.310
yowasa to fuan no naka de shitte

00:24:37.380 --> 00:24:43.860
I won’t say goodbye, Because forever

00:24:37.380 --> 00:24:43.860
sayonara wa iwanai yo datte itsumademo

00:24:44.050 --> 00:24:49.140
the days will be unchanged.

00:24:44.050 --> 00:24:49.140
kawaru koto no nai hibi

00:24:49.330 --> 00:24:55.980
Surely forever. M

00:24:49.330 --> 00:24:55.980
kitto itsumademo

